<section id="S4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.2. </span>Datasets</h3>

<div id="S4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Two publicly available benchmarks provide the labelled samples required for probe training
and evaluation. Table <a href="#S4.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 4.2. Datasets ‣ 4. Experimental Setup ‣ Adaptive Activation Cancellation for Hallucination Mitigationin Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> summarises their properties and roles in the pipeline.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6. </span>Datasets used for activation extraction, probe training, and generation evaluation.</figcaption>
