<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2. </span>Selectivity, reduction, and drift vs. percentile threshold for OPT-125M. Selectivity rises super-linearly above the 90th percentile as drift approaches zero.</figcaption>
